    "description": "``RecursiveDirectoryIterator`` extends ``FilesystemIterator`` to recursively traverse an entire directory tree. Combined with ``RecursiveIteratorIterator``, it visits every file and sub-directory under a root path.",
    "code": "<?php\n\n    $iterator = new RecursiveIteratorIterator(\n        new RecursiveDirectoryIterator('/path/to/dir', FilesystemIterator::SKIP_DOTS)\n    );\n    \n    foreach ($iterator as $file) {\n        if ($file->isFile()) {\n            echo $file->getPathname() . PHP_EOL;\n        }\n    }\n\n?>",
